@startuml migration-classes
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title CR-VAS-010: Migration Classes (M0..M4) and Trigger Conditions

package "Migration Class Selection" as MCS {
  (M0: No migration) as M0
  (M1: Mechanical) as M1
  (M2: Reviewed) as M2
  (M3: Semantic Reassessment) as M3
  (M4: Requalification Required) as M4
}

package "Trigger Conditions" as TC {
  (Existing artifacts valid) as T0
  (Deterministic structural transform) as T1
  (Validation or human review needed) as T2
  (Qualification or invariant change) as T3
  (Formal reevaluation required) as T4
}

T0 --> M0
T1 --> M1
T2 --> M2
T3 --> M3
T4 --> M4

M0 ..> M1 : upgrade
M1 ..> M2 : review-needed
M2 ..> M3 : semantics
M3 ..> M4 : requalify

note bottom of MCS
  Per CR-VAS-010 §14: Class MUST be selected based
  on semantic impact, not implementation convenience.
  Per SV-INV-005: Migration transformations MUST be
  explicit. The repository MUST NOT silently infer
  missing semantic evidence.
end note

@enduml
